WEBVTT

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:40.070
There you are!

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:42.410
I'm Mitsuboshi. I called earlier.

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:45.180
You're Asahi Koube, right?

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:49.040
Nice to meet you.

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:53.300
I told you over the phone. I found
a clue related to your flyers

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:55.760
-while I was traveling.
-Traveling?

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:59.000
It was at Yokoshina station.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:03.130
It's far, but you can get there
without changing trains.

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:05.640
It's not impossible.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:08.060
What's your clue?

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:16.920
Hold on!

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:18.950
Shio... Shio...

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:20.990
Shio!

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:32.920
Someone had turned that in
to the station.

00:02:33.350 --> 00:02:35.190
I thought there might be

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:37.800
a connection with the girl
in the flyer.

00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:40.030
Am I right?

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:46.200
But she's been missing
for three months now, right?

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:48.070
The most likely explanation

00:02:48.070 --> 00:02:52.440
is that someone lured her
and took her somewhere.

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:56.820
In that case, that person
would try to run far away

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:59.610
instead of staying around here.

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:04.530
Your odds of finding her are
better there than here.

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:07.200
He's right.

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:11.370
This is real.
It's Mom's handwriting.

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:13.630
This is definitely Shio's.

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:16.550
This is my first clue!

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:21.130
This guy's story makes sense.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:23.900
But there's still something
holding me back.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.870
Why? Why?

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:30.350
Think! Think! Think!

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:36.070
Hey. I can help you.

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:37.280
-So--
-Wait!

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:39.460
-Can I ask you something?
-Okay.

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:45.200
How did you know I was the person
you called just by looking at me?

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:48.700
What are you talking about?

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:51.040
We met each other before, right?

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:55.250
I saved you when those thugs
were bothering you.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:57.250
-No!
-Huh?

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:00.210
Then why didn't you
say that earlier?

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:03.250
You didn't say anything
about that until now.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:06.140
That's weird! Something's off!

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:08.950
You're hiding something.

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:11.640
You're trying to trick me.

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:13.950
This is just a game for you, right?

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:16.770
You smell like a dirty grown-up!

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:22.030
You smell like a dirty, lying,
hopeless hypocrite of an adult!

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:30.450
I'm nothing like that woman!

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.760
I'm nothing like that woman...

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:35.540
Stop saying I'm like that dirty woman!

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:37.960
No! I'm not like her!

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:43.420
Wait!

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:54.160
Shio...

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:56.240
Shio... Shio...

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:58.610
Shio... Shio!

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.150
I'm an idiot.

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:06.570
That guy

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:10.430
is my real clue for finding Shio!

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:13.680
He's gone.

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:20.230
He's gone.

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:38.940
There are lots of threads.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:42.550
I finally found a real one.

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:45.070
I should be happy.

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:49.890
But my heart feels
like it's about to be crushed.

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:53.800
If I pull this thread,
I might find the answer.

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:56.330
Shio might not be alive anymore...

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:02.560
It's like I'm walking towards
the edge of a cliff.

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:06.420
The further I go,
the more scared I get.

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:10.730
But even so, I can't let go
of this thread.

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:14.580
No matter what the answer is...

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:16.660
I won't give up!

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:19.600
My biggest fear
is not being able to find her.

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:22.420
So I'm going to find her!
No matter what!

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:29.630
Shio...

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:45.000
How did it go?

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:47.310
I found a clue.

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:50.390
Who gave you the clue?

00:06:51.650 --> 00:06:54.370
I don't know his name
or his address.

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:57.740
All I know is that
he was a young blond guy.

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:00.990
He looked
like a hard-working guy.

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:02.980
Did he wear a hairpin?

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:04.880
Yeah.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:07.860
Do you know him?

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:12.370
Sorry. I don't know.

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:15.680
But I don't think
you should listen to him.

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:19.000
We're not even sure
if that's true or not.

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:21.260
I'm going to go anyway.

00:07:21.260 --> 00:07:23.420
Thanks for everything.

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:25.930
You're a good person.

00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:28.180
I'm forever in your debt.

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:31.260
I think we'll never see each other
again.

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:33.240
Take care.

00:07:34.490 --> 00:07:35.820
Bye.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.900
Why don't you just stop?

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:47.210
You look like you're in
a lot of pain.

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:50.550
You should take care
of yourself more!

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:55.590
You can't live on without feeling
any happiness.

00:07:55.590 --> 00:07:59.160
Can't you find happiness
yourself first?

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:01.580
No.

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:08.670
This is the only kind of happiness
I know.

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:13.030
They say there are many types
of happiness.

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:16.190
But I can't understand.
I can't imagine it.

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:19.870
Living together with my mom
and Shio is my happiness.

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:23.200
Everything else is meaningless!

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:28.470
So I'm going to get Shio back
for my happiness!

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:34.610
And I have to tell Shio
not to turn out like me! That's why--

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:40.080
Sorry...

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:41.620
Sorry.

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:45.540
Sorry for saying something
so mean.

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:50.380
I might be broken already.

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:51.970
That's not true!

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:54.060
You're amazing.

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:56.430
You really care about others.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:59.230
You're shaking...

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:02.350
You're scared,
but you're still moving forward.

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:04.520
You're amazing!

00:09:06.450 --> 00:09:08.460
I hate it too.

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:12.070
I hate staying in the darkness
and having regrets.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:14.780
Yeah. I hate it.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:20.790
Oh. Don't cry!

00:09:21.470 --> 00:09:23.180
There, there.

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:26.930
Hey. You have a phone, right?

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:29.300
-Let's exchange numbers.
-Huh?

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:32.130
Come on!
I'll message you, okay?

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:35.300
I'm sure

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:40.440
there's light at
the end of your journey.

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:42.640
So promise me

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:47.040
that you're going to smile
at the end. Okay?

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:53.150
Oh, man.

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:03.040
I wonder why...

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:05.000
I'm jealous of her.

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:09.150
You're really weak
and not very manly.

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:11.360
And you're not my type.

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:14.710
But I wish you were my prince.

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:15.920
Just kidding.

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.400
You look terrible.

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:28.070
I said everything I was supposed to.

00:10:28.070 --> 00:10:31.830
I'm not sure whether
he believed me, though.

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:35.840
I think he's suspicious.

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:38.360
Yeah. I got it.

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:41.740
I'll do what you
tell me to, Matsuzaka.

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:46.160
So when are you going to let me
see Shio-chan?

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:48.750
I see.

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:52.100
I'll do my best.
Tell her I said hi.

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:59.150
I want Shio-chan
to purify me soon!

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:02.740
Let's do this!

00:11:23.960 --> 00:11:25.410
I knew it.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:28.220
I knew he'd take the first train.

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:40.430
I'm glad I took action now.

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:44.640
The world outside
is filled with impurities.

00:11:45.190 --> 00:11:46.350
People I hate.

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:48.060
People in my way.

00:11:48.860 --> 00:11:50.270
Liars.

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:53.310
Dirty people.

00:11:57.290 --> 00:12:00.320
I need to eliminate all risks.

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:06.450
I was always alone.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.570
Always numb.

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:10.820
Something was always missing.

00:12:10.820 --> 00:12:13.310
I was always sad.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:17.400
I thought I would end up
dying alone.

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:21.570
But I was wrong.

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:26.200
Shio-chan found me
and proved me wrong!

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:32.640
That's right!

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:37.730
The sky is sparkling.

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.650
Today's our anniversary!

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:45.590
An anniversary for celebrating
the day I eliminated that thing!

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:50.080
Thank you!

00:13:07.690 --> 00:13:09.390
I'm back!

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:13.310
Huh? Satou-chan,
where did you go?

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:18.270
I smell something sweet!

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:19.900
Did you bring something?

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.580
Huh? I wonder what it is...

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:25.150
Hey! No keeping secrets!

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:27.620
You're a bad girl!

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:30.700
Wait! Shio-chan!

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:34.040
No... No, Shio-chan!

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:42.850
We're going to spend all day
together today!

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:44.940
Really? Yay!

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:48.630
Mille-feuille, Charlotte,

00:13:48.630 --> 00:13:52.520
black forest, Sachertorte
and tiramisu.

00:13:53.820 --> 00:13:56.630
Satou-chan, what's the occasion?

00:13:56.630 --> 00:13:58.610
It's a tiny celebration.

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:02.280
This one's amazing! Black forest?

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:10.580
Sweet and soft! Black forest!

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:14.000
There are lots of different kinds
of cake!

00:14:21.850 --> 00:14:25.360
They're all sweet, but they're all
a little different!

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:28.260
Satou-chan, cake is mysterious!

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:32.350
It's sweet, it's sweet...

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:34.780
Hey. Let's split them in half.

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:36.140
Are you sure?

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:39.060
I have to protect this life.

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:42.670
I want to eat them together!

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:48.250
This is where I belong.

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:49.740
Hey, Satou-chan.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.420
Is it good?

00:15:04.140 --> 00:15:05.340
Yup!

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:08.820
I'm going to protect her,
no matter what!

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:11.600
It's really good!

00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:16.390
In this sweet, gentle
and pure castle.

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:23.550
-Hey, Satou-chan.
-Hmm?

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:27.250
-Who made those cakes just now?
-Huh?

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.320
Um...

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:32.340
Maybe it was someone at the bakery.

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:38.920
-Think I could bake them too?
-Huh?

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:41.080
Satou-chan, you like cake, right?

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.930
But it won't happen anytime soon...

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:46.650
I've never cooked.

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:48.760
But I'll work hard!

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:53.380
I want to bake a cake
for you someday

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:56.390
and make you smile!

00:15:57.570 --> 00:16:00.390
-Someday?
-Yeah! Someday.

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:03.640
From now... From here on...

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:06.320
Tomorrow... Next year...
The future...

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:10.810
Huh?

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:13.670
What is this feeling?

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:15.870
Satou-chan?

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:21.260
I've never thought about the future
until now.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:24.950
It was sort of... You know...

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:28.340
My life didn't have any taste.

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:30.990
My days weren't even rusty.

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:32.970
They were meaningless.

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:35.430
But it's different now.

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:39.100
What should I do?
I've never felt like this before!

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:42.270
It's fun to think about the future
with you!

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:45.620
That's right!

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:48.230
I want to share every moment
with you!

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:50.650
Forever and ever!

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:55.990
-Let's have a wedding!
-Huh?

00:16:56.220 --> 00:17:01.040
A wedding is a promise
that you'll be together forever.

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:02.800
I heard about it.

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:04.760
So let's promise.

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:07.630
We'll be together forever! Okay?

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:11.710
I promise!

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:22.780
Let' have a wedding right now!

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:26.600
Let's get a veil and flowers!

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:29.020
Okay! Okay!

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:36.360
-I'll be right back, okay?
-Okay!

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:40.220
Satou-chan, I love you!

00:17:42.970 --> 00:17:46.710
I'm so happy right now!

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:49.270
Oh, Shio-chan.

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:12.980
Satou!

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:52.120
The little bird was abandoned
by the girl,

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:53.910
and sunk to the ground

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:55.670
in loneliness.

00:18:55.670 --> 00:18:59.110
However, as if by instinct,

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:00.530
she flew again.

00:19:04.880 --> 00:19:08.670
The little bird
tried to reach her heart.

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:29.330
The bird sang to her heart.

00:20:29.800 --> 00:20:31.660
Her song

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:35.340
melted into the sound of the rain.

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:45.760
But she still sang.

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:47.930
She sang.

00:20:48.360 --> 00:20:51.270
She sang.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:55.440
A gentle song.

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:28.860
The little bird won't give up
anymore.

00:21:29.570 --> 00:21:32.140
She's tired of giving up.

00:21:32.610 --> 00:21:36.290
All that's left is to give it a try.

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:47.120
The cute little chick.

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:50.910
A cry-baby and a brave
singing bird.

00:21:52.180 --> 00:21:55.540
Face me! I'm sure we'll understand
each other.

00:21:56.510 --> 00:21:58.480
It's no use, Shoko-chan.

00:21:58.480 --> 00:22:02.660
I don't feel anything
for you at all.

00:22:02.660 --> 00:22:05.220
You're no different
from everyone else.

00:22:07.320 --> 00:22:09.880
I don't care!
Even if you're the devil,

00:22:09.880 --> 00:22:12.530
I still love you!

00:22:12.530 --> 00:22:15.690
I'll bring you back to the light!

00:22:15.690 --> 00:22:17.190
Satou!

00:22:17.990 --> 00:22:19.190
Hey.

00:22:19.420 --> 00:22:21.990
Did you really think
I'd buy your lie

00:22:21.990 --> 00:22:24.340
that you're not telling the police?

00:22:25.790 --> 00:22:27.530
You rejected me

00:22:28.130 --> 00:22:30.070
that one time, remember?

00:22:30.630 --> 00:22:32.040
How am I

00:22:32.300 --> 00:22:35.430
supposed to believe
a girl like that?

00:22:37.550 --> 00:22:39.250
So...

00:22:40.140 --> 00:22:41.670
Sorry.

00:23:34.030 --> 00:23:36.200
Satou-chan?

00:23:39.490 --> 00:23:42.300
The reason I can't hear
the bird anymore

00:23:42.300 --> 00:23:44.460
isn't because of the rain.

00:23:57.880 --> 00:24:01.390
Satou-chan, did you really do it for me?

00:24:01.390 --> 00:24:04.310
Are your eyes on me?

00:24:04.310 --> 00:24:07.260
Or on yourself?

00:24:07.260 --> 00:24:10.800
10th Life:
A Proposal under a Starry Sky.
